      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Growth
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Investment
     </span>
     <span>
      →
     </span>
     <span>
      Exit/IPO
     </span>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="eyebrow">
    // Cardi Ecosystem
   </div>
   <h2>
    What is Cardi Nusantara?
